#: about.php include/global_arrays.php lib/html.php
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "O programu Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Cacti je osmišljen kao potpuno rješenje za izradu grafikona zasnovano na RRDtool bazi podataka vremenskih serija (TSDB) i rješenju za izradu grafikona. Njegov cilj je da olakša posao mrežnog administratora vodeći računa o svim važnim detaljima potrebnim za kreiranje smislenih grafikona."

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Molimo posjetite zvaničnu %sCacti web stranicu%s za informacije o korištenju programa Cacti, dobivanju podrške i ažuriranjima."

#: about.php
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Aktivni programeri"

#: about.php
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Programeri koji rade na programu Cacti, njegovoj arhitekturi, dokumentaciji i budućim izdanjima."

#: about.php
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Počasna priznanja"

#: about.php
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Saradnici za dokumentaciju, QA, pakovanje, forume i našu YouTube stranicu."

#: about.php
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Emeritus članovi"

#: about.php
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Članovi prvobitne Cacti grupe koji su u međuvremenu nastavili svoje karijere. I dalje im želimo sve najbolje."

#: about.php
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Zahvale"

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Posebna zahvalnost %sTobiju Oetikeru%s, kreatoru alata %sRRDtool%s i veoma popularnog alata %sMRTG%s."

#: about.php
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Korisnici programa Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Posebno svima koji su odvojili vrijeme da kreiraju prijavu problema ili na drugi način pomognu u rješavanju problema vezanih za Cacti. Također i svima koji su doprinijeli podršci za Cacti."

#: about.php
msgid "License"
msgstr "Licenca"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti je licenciran pod GNU GPL licencom:"

#: about.php lib/installer.php
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Ovaj program je slobodan softver; možete ga redistribuirati i/ili mijenjati pod uslovima GNU Opće javne licence (GNU General Public License) koju je objavila Free Software Foundation; bilo verzije 2 Licence ili (po vašem izboru) bilo koje novije verzije."

#: about.php
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Ovaj program se distribuira u nadi da će biti koristan, ali BEZ IKAKVE GARANCIJE; čak i bez podrazumijevane garancije TRŽIŠNE VRIJEDNOSTI ili PRIKLADNOSTI ZA ODREĐENU NAMJENU. Pogledajte GNU Opću javnu licencu za više detalja."

