msgid "Should the Has Graphs and Has Data Sources be Checked by Default."
msgstr "Da li opcije Ima grafikone i Ima izvore podataka trebaju biti podrazumijevano označene."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "RRDtool Version"
msgstr "RRDtool verzija"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The version of RRDtool that you have installed."
msgstr "Verzija alata RRDtool koju imate instaliranu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Gradient Support"
msgstr "Omogući podršku za gradijent"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enabled Gradient Support for AREA and STACK charts."
msgstr "Omogućena podrška za gradijent za AREA i STACK grafikone."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Metoda dozvola za grafikone"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Postoje četiri metode za određivanje korisničkih dozvola za grafikone. Prva je 'Popustljiva'. Prema postavci 'Popustljiva', korisniku je potreban pristup ili grafikonu, uređaju ili šablonu grafikona da bi dobio pristup grafikonima koji se na njih odnose. Prema postavci 'Restriktivna', korisnik mora imati pristup i grafikonu, i uređaju, i šablonu grafikona da bi dobio pristup grafikonu. Prve dvije metode imaju problema sa skalabilnošću kod veoma velikih instalacija. Stoga su dostupne dvije dodatne opcije. To su 'Na osnovu uređaja', što znači da ako imate pristup uređaju, dobijate pristup njegovim grafikonima. I na kraju 'Na osnovu šablona grafikona', što znači da ako imate pristup 'Šablonu grafikona', dobijate pristup svim grafikonima uređaja tog šablona."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Popustljiva"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Restriktivna"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Na osnovu uređaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Metoda kreiranja grafikona/izvora podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Ako je postavljeno na Jednostavna, grafikoni i izvori podataka mogu se kreirati samo iz opcije Novi grafikoni. Ako je Napredna, podržano je naslijeđeno kreiranje grafikona i izvora podataka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Jednostavna"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Napredna"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Prikaži pomoć za obrasce/postavke direktno u prikazu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Kada je označeno, pomoć za obrasce i postavke bit će prikazana direktno u prikazu. U suprotnom će biti prikazana prilikom prelaska mišem preko dugmeta za pomoć."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Samo lokalna pomoć za stranicu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Podrazumijevano se pomoć za Cacti stranice nalazi na adresi docs.cacti.net. Međutim, ako vaš sistem nema pristup internetu, možete preuzeti dokumentaciju lokalno u HTML formatu i postaviti je na lokaciju 'docs' vašeg Cacti servera. Ako želite koristiti samo lokalnu lokaciju za dokumentaciju pomoći stranice, označite ovo polje za potvrdu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Potvrda brisanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Pitaj korisnika prije brisanja stavke."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Unaprijed postavljeno očuvanje izvora podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Kada je omogućeno, Cacti će postaviti radio dugme na brisanje povezanih izvora podataka grafikona prilikom uklanjanja grafikona. Napomena: Cacti neće dozvoliti uklanjanje izvora podataka ako se koriste u drugim grafikonima."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Automatsko otključavanje grafikona"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Kada je omogućeno, Cacti neće zaključavati grafikone. Ovo omogućava bržu ručnu izmjenu izvora podataka povezanih s grafikonom."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Sakrij Cacti kontrolnu tablu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Za upotrebu s Cacti podrškom za vanjske linkove. Korištenjem ove postavke možete sakriti Cacti kontrolnu tablu, tako da možete prikazati samo vlastitu stranicu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Omogući prevlačenje i ispuštanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Neki od Cacti interfejsa podržavaju prevlačenje i ispuštanje. Ako je označeno, ova opcija će biti omogućena. Napomena: Za slabovidne korisnike ova opcija može biti onemogućena."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Sigurnost stranice"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Prisili veze preko HTTPS-a"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Kada je označeno, svi pokušaji pristupa Cactiju bit će preusmjereni na HTTPS radi visoke sigurnosti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Dozvoli nesigurni HTTPS za udaljeni sakupljač podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Dozvoli korištenje samopotpisanih certifikata i dozvoli da se ime hosta na certifikatu razlikuje od imena udaljenog sakupljača podataka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Dozvoli nesigurne metaznakove u metodama unosa podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Historijski gledano, Cacti administratori su kreirali jednostavne metode unosa podataka koje uključuju naredbe poput \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" za prikaz numeričke vrijednosti za upotrebu u Cacti grafikonima. U ranijim verzijama Cacti sistema to je bilo dozvoljeno. Međutim, ovo je nesigurna praksa jer otvara put korisnicima trećih strana da objavljuju nesigurne šablone podataka. U modernom Cacti sistemu ovakve prakse treba izbjegavati. Ipak, nudimo ovu opciju ako imate starije metode unosa podataka koje sadrže ove nesigurne metaznakove i još ih niste konvertovali u lokalne skripte u direktoriju 'scripts'. Kada ova opcija nije označena, Cacti ograničava metaznakove u stilu ljuske (shell), kao što su navodnici, vitičaste zagrade, uspravne crte, obrnute kose crte i obrnuti apostrofi. Cacti i dalje dozvoljava znakove veće-od i manje-od za stvari kao što je <path_cacti> i za ulazne parametre, ali ako ova opcija nije označena, to je granica njihove dozvoljene upotrebe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Politika sigurnosti sadržaja za skripte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Kontroliše script-src CSP politiku. U Nonce režimima, Cacti dodaci koji koriste umetnuti JavaScript moraju uključiti nonce atribut iz ugrađene Cacti funkcije 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. U suprotnom, preglednik će blokirati te skripte. Trenutno Cacti dozvoljava samo prijavljivanje Cacti dodataka koji ne koriste pravilno Nonce režim. U budućnosti ćemo omogućiti administratorima da blokiraju takve dodatke u korištenju umetnutog JavaScripta ako ne koriste Nonce."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Dozvoli umetnuti JavaScript bez Nonce atributa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Dozvoli i unsafe-eval i umetnuti JavaScript bez Nonce atributa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Nonce režim - samo izvještavanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI za izvještaje o kršenju CSP-a"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL na koji preglednici šalju POST izvještaje o kršenju CSP politike u nonce-report i nonce režimima. Ostavite prazno da biste koristili <url_path>/csp_report.php. Smije sadržavati samo sigurne URL znakove."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Alternativni izvori za Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Nazivi domena odvojeni razmakom kojima će biti dozvoljen pristup izvan samog web servera. Ovo je važno za korisnike koji odluče koristiti CDN ili hosting stranicu. Izvori mogu uključivati džokerske znakove, na primjer: *.mydomain.com, ili protokol, na primjer: https://*.example.com. Ovi alternativni izvori uključuju samo tipove slika, CSS i JavaScript."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL na koji preglednici šalju POST izvještaje o kršenju CSP politike u nonce-report i nonce režimima. Ostavite prazno da biste koristili /cacti/csp_report.php u korijenskom direktoriju instalacije. Smije sadržavati samo sigurne URL znakove."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Omogući automatsko kreiranje grafikona"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Kada je onemogućeno, Cacti automatizacija neće aktivno kreirati nijedan grafikon. Ovo je korisno prilikom podešavanja postavki uređaja kako bi se izbjeglo kreiranje novih grafikona svaki put kada sačuvate objekat. Ručno pokretanje pravila automatizacije će i dalje biti moguće."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Omogući automatsko kreiranje stavki stabla"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Kada je onemogućeno, Cacti automatizacija neće aktivno kreirati nijednu stavku stabla. Ovo je korisno prilikom podešavanja postavki uređaja ili grafikona kako bi se izbjeglo kreiranje novih unosa u stablo svaki put kada sačuvate objekat. Ručno pokretanje pravila će i dalje biti moguće."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Email adresa primaoca za obavještenja automatizacije"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
