msgstr "Naziv gostujućeg korisnika za pregled grafikona; podrazumijevano je 'Bez korisnika'."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Šablon korisnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Cacti will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Naziv korisnika kojeg će Cacti koristiti kao šablon za nove Web Basic i LDAP korisnike; podrazumijevano je 'guest'. Ovom korisničkom nalogu će prijava biti onemogućena nakon odabira."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Postavke osnovne autentifikacije"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Poruka o neuspjeloj prijavi kod osnovne autentifikacije"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Cacti account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Prilikom korištenja osnovne autentifikacije, ako dođe do problema pri mapiranju korisničkog imena na važeći Cacti nalog, korisnicima će biti prikazana poruka navedena ovdje. Može sadržavati i tekst i HTML."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Datoteka mapiranja za osnovnu autentifikaciju"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Prilikom korištenja osnovne autentifikacije, ako osnovni nalog treba prevesti u drugi nalog za prijavu, ovdje možete navesti CSV datoteku za mapiranje osnovnog naloga na željeni nalog za prijavu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Zahtjevi složenosti za lokalne naloge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Minimalna dužina"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Ovo je minimalna dužina dozvoljenih lozinki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj kombinaciju velikih i malih slova"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contains both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da nove lozinke sadrže i mala i velika slova."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj broj"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da nove lozinke sadrže najmanje 1 numerički znak."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj specijalni znak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da nove lozinke sadrže najmanje 1 specijalni znak."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Primijeni složenost na stare lozinke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da sve stare lozinke također ispunjavaju nove uslove složenosti prilikom prijave. Ako nisu ispunjeni, prisilit će promjenu lozinke."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Istek neaktivnih računa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Ovo je maksimalan broj dana prije nego što neaktivni računi budu onemogućeni. Administratorski račun je izuzet iz ove politike."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "Istek lozinke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Ovo je maksimalan broj dana prije nego što lozinka istekne."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Password History"
msgstr "Historija lozinki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remember this number of old passwords and disallow reusing them."
msgstr "Zapamti ovaj broj starih lozinki i zabrani njihovo ponovno korištenje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Change"
msgstr "1 promjena"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Changes"
msgstr "%d promjena"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Locking"
msgstr "Zaključavanje naloga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock Accounts"
msgstr "Zaključaj naloge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock an account after this many failed attempts in 1 hour."
msgstr "Zaključaj nalog nakon ovoliko neuspjelih pokušaja u roku od 1 sata."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Attempt"
msgstr "1 pokušaj"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Attempts"
msgstr "%d pokušaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Automatsko otključavanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "An account will automatically be unlocked after this many minutes.  Even if the correct password is entered, the account will not unlock until this time limit has been met.  Max of 1440 minutes (1 Day)"
msgstr "Nalog će se automatski otključati nakon ovoliko minuta. Čak i ako se unese ispravna lozinka, nalog se neće otključati dok ovo vremensko ograničenje ne istekne. Maksimalno 1440 minuta (1 dan)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "1 dan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP General Settings"
msgstr "Opće LDAP postavke"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Server(s)"
msgstr "Server(i)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Cacti will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user.<br><br>For One-Time Password (OTP/MFA) logins, do not use a space delimited multi-server list.  On a failed bind Cacti advances to the next server and re-binds with the same credentials, and the already-consumed one-time code will be rejected.  Instead enter a single, resilient DNS name fronted by a DNS load balancer (VIP) so that server failover is handled below Cacti and only one authentication bind is ever performed."
msgstr "Lista DNS naziva hostova ili IP adresa za važeće LDAP servere odvojena razmacima. Cacti će pokušati koristiti LDAP servere slijeva nadesno kako bi autentifikovao korisnika.<br><br>Za prijave jednokratnom lozinkom (OTP/MFA) nemojte koristiti listu više servera odvojenu razmacima. Pri neuspjelom povezivanju (bind), Cacti prelazi na sljedeći server i ponovo vrši povezivanje s istim pristupnim podacima, pa će već iskorišteni jednokratni kod biti odbijen. Umjesto toga unesite jedan otporan DNS naziv ispred kojeg se nalazi DNS balanser opterećenja (VIP), tako da se prebacivanje servera u slučaju kvara obrađuje ispod aplikacije Cacti i uvijek se vrši samo jedno autentifikacijsko povezivanje."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port Standard"
msgstr "Standardni port"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for Non-SSL communications including LDAP + TLS.  Default is 389."
msgstr "TCP port za ne-SSL komunikaciju, uključujući LDAP + TLS. Podrazumijevano je 389."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port SSL"
msgstr "SSL port"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for LDAPS for SSL communications.  Default is 636."
msgstr "TCP port za LDAPS za SSL komunikaciju. Podrazumijevano je 636."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Protocol Version"
msgstr "Verzija protokola"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Protocol Version to connect to the server with."
msgstr "Verzija protokola za povezivanje sa serverom."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena povezivanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Network Connect Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Istek vremena mrežnog povezivanja u sekundama."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bind Timeout"
msgstr "Vrijeme isteka povezivanja (bind)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Bind Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Istek vremena vezivanja u sekundama."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP Debug Mode"
msgstr "LDAP režim otklanjanja grešaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Cacti will log extra LDAP information to the Cacti log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, Cacti će bilježiti dodatne LDAP informacije u Cacti zapisnik tokom aktivnosti vezivanja i pretraživanja."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Šifriranje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Encryption that the server supports. NOTE: When using LDAP + TLS you must use version 3."
msgstr "Enkripcija koju server podržava. NAPOMENA: Kada koristite LDAP + TLS, morate koristiti verziju 3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "Zahtjevi za TLS certifikat"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should LDAP verify TLS Certificates when received by the Client."
msgstr "Da li LDAP treba provjeravati TLS certifikate kada ih klijent primi."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Upućivanja"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "Omogućite ili onemogućite LDAP upućivanja. Ako je onemogućeno, to može povećati brzinu pretraga."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Režim"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>One-Time Passwords (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti binds the user's password only once, during final authentication.  <i>No Searching</i> performs no directory lookup and binds directly using the Distinguished Name (DN) template, so it is safe for OTP when the DN template alone identifies the user.  When a directory lookup is required to resolve the DN, use <i>Specific Searching</i> with a dedicated service account (or <i>Anonymous Searching</i> where the directory permits it) so the lookup never consumes the user's single-use code.  For resilient OTP deployments use a single DNS load balancer name in the Server(s) field rather than a space delimited multi-server list, which would re-attempt the bind with an already-consumed one-time password."
msgstr "Način na koji će Cacti pokušati izvršiti autentifikaciju prema LDAP serveru.<blockquote><i>Bez pretraživanja</i> - Ne vrši se pretraživanje razlikovnog imena (DN), već se samo pokušava vezivanje pomoću navedenog formata razlikovnog imena (DN).<br><br><i>Anonimno pretraživanje</i> - Pokušava pretražiti korisničko ime u LDAP direktoriju putem anonimnog vezivanja kako bi pronašao korisnikovo razlikovno ime (DN).<br><br><i>Specifično pretraživanje</i> - Pokušava pretražiti korisničko ime u LDAP direktoriju putem specifičnog razlikovnog imena (DN) i specifične lozinke za vezivanje kako bi pronašao korisnikovo razlikovno ime (DN).<br><br><i>Jednokratne lozinke (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti povezuje korisničku lozinku samo jednom, tokom konačne autentifikacije. <i>Bez pretraživanja</i> ne vrši pretragu direktorija i veže se direktno koristeći šablon razlikovnog imena (DN), tako da je sigurno za OTP kada sam DN šablon identifikuje korisnika. Kada je potrebna pretraga direktorija za razrješavanje DN-a, koristite <i>Specifično pretraživanje</i> sa namjenskim servisnim nalogom (ili <i>Anonimno pretraživanje</i> gdje direktorij to dozvoljava) kako pretraga nikada ne bi potrošila korisnikov jednokratni kod. Za otporne OTP implementacije koristite jedno ime DNS balansera opterećenja u polju Server(i) umjesto liste više servera odvojenih razmakom, što bi ponovo pokušalo vezivanje sa već potrošenom jednokratnom lozinkom."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Istaknuto ime (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Sintaksa za \"Istaknuto ime\", primjenjiva i na OpenLDAP i na Windows AD konfiguracije, pruža fleksibilnost pri definisanju identiteta korisnika. Za OpenLDAP format prati ovu strukturu: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD nudi alternativnu sintaksu: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, opšte poznatu kao \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". U ovom kontekstu, \"&lt;username&gt;\" predstavlja konkretno korisničko ime uneseno prilikom upita za prijavu. Ovo je posebno važno kada se radi u režimu \"Bez pretraživanja\" ili kada je omogućena opcija \"Zahtijevaj članstvo u grupi\"."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require Group Membership"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj članstvo u grupi"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require user to be member of group to authenticate. Group settings must be set for this to work, enabling without proper group settings will cause authentication failure."
msgstr "Zahtijeva da korisnik bude član grupe da bi se autentificirao. Postavke grupe moraju biti podešene da bi ovo radilo; omogućavanje bez ispravnih postavki grupe uzrokovat će neuspjeh autentifikacije."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Group Settings"
msgstr "Postavke LDAP grupe"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Istaknuto ime grupe (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that user must have membership."
msgstr "Razlikovno ime grupe u kojoj korisnik mora imati članstvo."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Atribut člana grupe"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Ovo se odnosi na određeni atribut unutar LDAP direktorija koji sadrži korisnička imena članova grupe. Ključno je osigurati da se vrijednost atributa podudara s konfiguracijom navedenom u \"Distinguished Name\" ili da je stvarna vrijednost atributa pretraživa pomoću postavki navedenih u \"Distinguished Name\"."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Type"
msgstr "Tip člana grupe"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined Group Member Attribute."
msgstr "Definiše da li korisnici koriste puno Distinguished Name ili samo korisničko ime u definisanom atributu člana grupe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Distinguished Name"
msgstr "Razlikovno ime"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Specific Search Settings"
msgstr "Postavke specifične LDAP pretrage"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "Baza pretrage"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> or <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."
msgstr "Baza pretrage za pretraživanje LDAP direktorija, kao što je <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> ili <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Filter"
msgstr "Filter pretrage"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt. "
msgstr "Filter pretrage koji se koristi za pronalaženje korisnika u LDAP direktoriju, kao što je za Windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> ili za OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>. '&lt;username&gt' se zamjenjuje korisničkim imenom koje je uneseno pri prijavi. "

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Distinguished Name (DN) za pretragu"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Distinguished Name za specifičnu pretragu prilikom povezivanja na LDAP direktorij."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Password"
msgstr "Lozinka za pretragu"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Password for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Lozinka za specifičnu pretragu prilikom povezivanja na LDAP direktorij."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP CN Settings"
msgstr "LDAP CN postavke"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Full Name when creating a new user, taken from LDAP. (on windows: displayname) "
msgstr "Polje koje će zamijeniti Puno ime prilikom kreiranja novog korisnika, preuzeto iz LDAP-a. (na Windowsu: displayname) "

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Email"
msgstr "Email"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Email taken from LDAP. (on windows: mail)"
msgstr "Polje koje će zamijeniti E-mail preuzet iz LDAP-a. (na Windowsu: mail)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL Linking"
msgstr "URL povezivanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Server Base URL"
