msgstr "Koliko često treba provjeravati RRD?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Storage Settings"
msgstr "Postavke skladištenja podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Choose if RRDs will be stored locally or being handled by an external RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Odaberite da li će se RRD-ovi skladištiti lokalno ili će njima upravljati vanjski RRDtool proxy server."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server"
msgstr "RRDtool proxy server"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Structure RRDfile Paths"
msgstr "Strukturiraj putanje RRD datoteka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Structured Paths"
msgstr "Omogući strukturirane putanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Use a separate subfolder for each hosts RRD files.  The naming of the RRDfiles will be one of the following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You can make this change after install by running the CLI script <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr "Koristite zaseban poddirektorij za RRD datoteke svakog hosta. Imenovanje RRD datoteka bit će jedno od sljedećeg:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Ovu promjenu možete napraviti nakon instalacije pokretanjem CLI skripte <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> nakon što izvršite promjenu. NAPOMENA: Ako promijenite vrijednost Maksimalan broj direktorija kako biste smanjili broj direktorija, ili ako promijenite Uzorak direktorija, prazni direktoriji neće biti uklonjeni nakon što ponovo pokrenete skriptu <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b>."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Directory Pattern"
msgstr "Uzorak direktorija"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which Directory Pattern do you wish to use for Structured RRD Paths.  'Device ID' is the default.  The setting 'Device ID/Data Query ID' should be used when you have Devices with thousands of Graphs.  After Changing the Directory Pattern, you must run the Structured Path CLI script again to modify the RRDfile paths to the new Pattern."
msgstr "Koji uzorak direktorija želite koristiti za strukturirane RRD putanje. 'ID uređaja' je podrazumijevano. Postavku 'ID uređaja/ID upita podataka' treba koristiti kada imate uređaje sa hiljadama grafikona. Nakon promjene uzorka direktorija, morate ponovo pokrenuti CLI skriptu za strukturirane putanje kako biste izmijenili putanje RRD datoteka na novi uzorak."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID"
msgstr "ID uređaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "ID uređaja/ID upita podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID"
msgstr "Hash uređaja/ID uređaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "Hash uređaja/ID uređaja/ID upita podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Device Hash Directories"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj hash direktorija uređaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum number of Device Directories to be created based upon hashed Device ID's."
msgstr "Maksimalan broj direktorija uređaja koji će biti kreirani na osnovu hashiranih ID-ova uređaja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Proxy server"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "DNS naziv hosta ili IP adresa RRDtool proxy servera."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Port Number"
msgstr "Broj porta proxy servera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication."
msgstr "TCP port za šifriranu komunikaciju."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "RSA otisak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Otisak trenutnog javnog RSA ključa koji proxy koristi. Ovo je potrebno za uspostavljanje pouzdane veze."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "RRDtool proxy server - Rezervni"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Load Balancing"
msgstr "Balansiranje opterećenja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Ako su i glavni i rezervni proxy dostupni, ova opcija omogućava raspodjelu svih zahtjeva prema RRDtool-u."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "DNS naziv hosta ili IP adresa rezervnog RRDtool proxy servera ako proxy radi u MSR režimu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication with the backup proxy."
msgstr "TCP port za šifriranu komunikaciju sa rezervnim proxyjem."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Otisak trenutnog javnog RSA ključa koji rezervni proxy koristi. Ovo je potrebno za uspostavljanje pouzdane veze."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Postavke uklanjanja skokova"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Metoda uklanjanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Postoje dvije metode uklanjanja. Prva, Standardna devijacija, uklonit će svaki uzorak koji je za X standardnih devijacija udaljen od prosjeka uzoraka. Druga metoda, Varijansa, uklonit će svaki uzorak koji je za X% veći od prosjeka varijanse. Metoda varijanse uzima u obzir određeni broj 'odstupanja' (outliers). To su izuzetni uzorci, poput naglih skokova, koje je potrebno isključiti iz proračuna prosjeka varijanse."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Standardna devijacija"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Na bazi varijanse sa uklonjenim odstupanjima"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Metoda zamjene"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Postoje tri metode zamjene. Prva metoda zamjenjuje skok prosjekom predmetnog izvora podataka. Druga metoda zamjenjuje skok vrijednošću 'NaN'. Posljednja zamjenjuje skok posljednjom pronađenom poznatom ispravnom vrijednošću."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Prosjek"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "NaN vrijednosti"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Posljednja poznata ispravna"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Broj standardnih devijacija"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Svaka vrijednost koja je za ovoliko standardnih devijacija iznad prosjeka bit će isključena. Dobar broj zavisi od vrste podataka na kojima se radi. Preporučujemo broj koji nije manji od 5 standardnih devijacija."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "%d standardnih devijacija"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Procenat varijanse"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Ova vrijednost predstavlja procenat iznad prilagođenog prosjeka uzorka nakon što su odstupanja uklonjena iz uzorka. Na primjer, procenat varijanse od 100%% na prilagođenom prosjeku od 50 uklonio bi sa grafikona svaki uzorak iznad količine 100."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Broj odstupanja za varijansu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Ova vrijednost predstavlja broj visokih i niskih prosječnih uzoraka koji će biti uklonjeni iz skupa uzoraka prije izračunavanja prosjeka varijanse. Ako odaberete vrijednost odstupanja od 5, uklanjaju se i gornjih 5 i donjih 5 prosjeka."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d High/Low Samples"
msgstr "%d visokih/niskih uzoraka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Kills Per RRA"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj uklanjanja po RRA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Ova vrijednost predstavlja maksimalan broj šiljaka koje treba ukloniti iz RRA grafikona."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Spikes"
msgstr "%d šiljaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Backup Directory"
msgstr "Direktorij za sigurnosnu kopiju RRD datoteka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this directory is not empty, then your original RRDfiles will be backed up to this location."
msgstr "Ako ovaj direktorij nije prazan, napravit će se sigurnosna kopija vaših originalnih RRD datoteka na ovoj lokaciji."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Batch Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Postavke grupnog uklanjanja šiljaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
