msgid "Your MySQL TimeZone database is not populated.  Please populate this database before proceeding."
msgstr "Vaša MySQL TimeZone baza podataka nije popunjena. Molimo vas da popunite ovu bazu podataka prije nastavka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Cacti database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "Vaš korisnički račun za prijavu u Cacti bazu podataka nema pristup MySQL TimeZone bazi podataka. Molimo vas da korisničkom računu Cacti baze podataka omogućite \"select\" pristup tabeli \"time_zone_name\" u bazi podataka \"mysql\" i popunite MySQL TimeZone informacije prije nastavka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "Vaš račun Cacti baze podataka ima pristup MySQL TimeZone bazi podataka i ta baza podataka je popunjena globalnim TimeZone informacijama."

