#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Cacti system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Ove postavke za podešavanje performansi MySQL-a pomoći će vašem Cacti sistemu da radi bolje bez problema duže vrijeme."

#: lib/installer.php
