msgid "Upgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Nadogradnja sa <strong>%s</strong> na <strong>%s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "U slučaju problema, toplo se preporučuje da očistite keš svog preglednika, zatvorite i ponovo otvorite preglednik (ne samo karticu u kojoj je Cacti) te pokušate ponovo, prije nego što prijavite problem grupi The Cacti Group"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "U rijetkim prilikama imali smo prijave korisnika koji su imali manje probleme zbog promjena u kodu. Ovi problemi su uzrokovani time što preglednik zadržava kod od prije nadogradnje i iako smo poduzeli korake da smanjimo šanse za to, ipak se može dogoditi. Ako su vam potrebne upute kako da očistite keš svog preglednika, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> je dobra polazna tačka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Ako nakon čišćenja keša i ponovnog pokretanja preglednika i dalje imate problema, molimo vas da nam prijavite problem i pokušat ćemo identificirati njegov uzrok."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Downgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Vraćanje na stariju verziju sa <strong>%s</strong> na <strong>%s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Čini se da vraćate sistem na prethodnu verziju. Promjene u bazi podataka napravljene za noviju verziju neće biti poništene i <i>mogle bi</i> uzrokovati probleme."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the type of installation"
msgstr "Molimo vas da odaberete vrstu instalacije"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Installation options:"
msgstr "Opcije instalacije:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Choose this for the Primary site."
msgstr "Odaberite ovo za primarnu lokaciju."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "New Primary Server"
msgstr "Novi primarni server"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "New Remote Poller"
msgstr "Novi udaljeni poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Pollers are used to access networks that are not readily accessible to the Primary site."
msgstr "Udaljeni polleri se koriste za pristup mrežama koje nisu direktno dostupne primarnoj lokaciji."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following information has been determined from Cacti's configuration file. If it is not correct, please edit \"include/config.php\" before continuing."
msgstr "Sljedeće informacije su utvrđene iz konfiguracijske datoteke za Cacti. Ako nisu tačne, molimo vas da uredite \"include/config.php\" prije nastavka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Local Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Informacije o povezivanju s lokalnom bazom podataka"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Baza podataka: <b>%s</b>"

